<title>PERU: Peru's Banco de Credito 11-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Banco de Credito 11-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - 0.42 sol vs 0.34 sol</p>
<p>Net - 247.8 million soles vs 202.0 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 770.3 million soles vs 620.3 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Banco de Credito, Peru's largest full-service bank, is 90.1 percent-owned by Credicorp Ltd..</p>
<p>((Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 222-2134))</p>
